# Next.js Frontend Architecture

The Pocket Agent frontend is a modern Next.js 14 application that provides a web interface for monitoring and interacting with Cursor chat sessions.

## Project Structure

### Core Application
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/(app)/](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/(app)/) - Main application routes
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/) - API routes for extension communication

### Authentication
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/(app)/(authentication)/](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/(app)/(authentication)/) - Auth pages (sign-in, sign-up, etc.)
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/lib/auth.ts](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/lib/auth.ts) - Auth.js configuration

### Chat Interface
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/(app)/chat/](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/(app)/chat/) - Chat monitoring interface
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/(app)/chat/_components/](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/(app)/chat/_components/) - Chat UI components

### Components & UI
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/components/](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/components/) - Reusable UI components
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/components/ui/](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/components/ui/) - Shadcn/UI components

## Key API Routes

### Extension Authentication
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/auth/vscode/github-exchange/route.ts](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/auth/vscode/github-exchange/route.ts) - Exchange GitHub tokens for service JWTs

### Chat Data Management
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/chat/update/route.ts](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/chat/update/route.ts) - Receive chat updates from extension
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/chats/list/route.ts](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/chats/list/route.ts) - List active chat sessions
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/chat/[windowId]/route.ts](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/chat/[windowId]/route.ts) - Get specific chat content

### Message Communication
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/message/send-to-cursor/route.ts](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/message/send-to-cursor/route.ts) - Send messages to Cursor
- [pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/commands/poll-outgoing/[windowId]/route.ts](mdc:pocket-agent-frontend/src/app/api/commands/poll-outgoing/[windowId]/route.ts) - Poll for outgoing commands

